Resolving ``distutils`` submodules no longer asks the import system where
``distutils`` lives. With setuptools installed that lookup went through its
``distutils`` shim, which imports ``setuptools`` through ``sys.path``, so a
``setuptools`` package next to the analysed sources was executed as soon as a
file imported ``distutils.util``. The lookup only served virtualenv < 20, which
cannot create environments for the Python versions astroid supports.

Refs #1386
Refs pylint-dev/pylint#5645
